 problem of detecting telecom company’s churn customers in economic\nterms with profit maximization. The achieved result is 0.3$ profit/churn customer.\n- Performed the efficient Facial Keypoint Detection with a\n3% mean error using TensorFlow tools.\n- Built robust models for efficient prediction of the hotel’s month revenue with a 13% Mean Absolute\nPercentage Error.\n- Developed a system recognizing hand-written digits with a 98% accuracy using neural networks.\n- Solved the problem of predicting the salary of IT-specialists with a 96.5% score.\n- Performed effective topic modeling for the Amazon Product Reviews data using NLP tools.\n\nОбразование\n\nВысшее\n\n2025 Белорусский государственный университет, Минск\nПрикладной Математики и Информатики, Информатика, математик-системный программист\n\nРезюме обновлено 23 мая 2024 в 15:39 \n\nGJ rabota.by\n\nКлючевые навыки\nЗнание языков Русский — Родной\n\nАнглийский — C1 — Продвинутый\n\nНавыки  TensorFlow      Scikit-learn      OpenCV      Python      Numpy      Pandas      Sklearn \n\n Keras      XGBoost      CatBoost      NLTK      Matplotlib      Seaborn      Plotly      C++ \n\n SQL      Git      GitHub      LightGBM      Машинное обучение      NLP \n\n Computer Vision      Linux      Английский язык      Базы данных      PyTorch      ML \n\n Machine Learning      Tensorflow      Deep Learning \n\nДополнительная информация\n\nОбо мне My name is Stanislav, I am 20 years old and I am currently a 3rd year BSU FAMCS student that’s\nengaged in Machine Learning.\nI consider myself as a hardworking, dilligent and motivated person who’s full of desire to\nself-develop and whose hard skills mostly include Python and its tools for solving Machine\nLearning and Data Analysis tasks. Also, ability to work in a team, sociability, flexibility and attention\nto details are definitely among my soft skills.\n\nЯцевич Станислав  •  Резюме обновлено 23 мая 2024 в 15:39 \n\nИстория общения с кандидатом\nОтклики Data Scientist\n\n21