[2026-01-27 16:46:50,359: WARNING/ForkPoolWorker-1] 🔍 Начинаем создание кандидата из данных: {'id': 104975581, 'url': 'https://store.huntflow.ru/uploads3/named/9/a/4/9a4bf6fdce73188c1c92d30404e89a16.pdf/LevCV.pdf?s=YCoegPdFbQiGIwxbTJplJw&e=1769564810', 'content_type': 'application/pdf', 'name': 'LevCV.pdf', 'text': "LEV\n\nPROFILE\n\nI’ve always been fond of science and technologies and their applications. I love to dig \ninto the way how things work. I’ve worked with different aspects and applications of \nmachine learning as well as solving deployment issues. I’m always looking forward to \nnew opportunities to  use my skills to make the world a better place. \n\nEXPERIENCE\n\nML/MLOps Engineer, Innowise — 2022–Present\n\nML System Maintenance:\n\n• MLOps practices assessment\n\n• Production system monitoring and debugging\n\n• Code & pipelines optimization\n\n• Integration of new ML related features\n\nEnvironment: Azure Cloud, Azure DevOps, SQL Server, Terraform.\n\nChat bot project:\n\n• Participated in system design and implementation\n\n• Collaborated with backend and frontend teams during development\n\n• Implemented AI service backed with OpenAI models to identify and execute \n\ndifferent user's actions\n\n• Conducted iterative prompt tuning to meet customer's expectations\n\n• Containerized AI services with docker, collaborated with DevOps team on CI/CD \n\npipeline design and troubleshooting\n\n• Monitored and debugged AI services in Kubernetes cluster using kubectl\n\n• Integrated customer related context into the chat-bot using llama-index\n\n• Proposed and pushed development best practices\n\nEnvironment: Azure Cloud, Langchain, ChromaDB, MongoDB, OpenAI, Kubernetes, \nCelery, RabbitMQ, FastAPI, Docker, Docker compose, Bitbucket.\n\nIn-house bot:\n\n• Integrated CV model into robot with ROS\n\n• Optimized inference time using ONNX runtime\n\n• Experimented with server side and on the edge inferencing\n\n• Created experimentation environment for ROS modules\n\nEnvironment: ROS Noetic, ONNX, ONNX Runtime, OpenCV, Bitbucket.\n\nMobile application:\n\n• Created C++ wrapper library for ONNX ML model\n\n• Prepared features computation in C++\n\nlev.taborov@icloud.com\n\nCERTIFICATES\n\nMicrosoft AI Engineer \nAssociate\n\nMicrosoft Data Scientist \nAssociate\n\nEDUCATION\n\nBSU, 2019-2023 —\u2028\nBS in Computer \nMathematics, Software \nengineering and system \nanalysis,\n\nBSU Lyceum, 2017-2019 —\u2028\nProfiled education in \nMaths, CS and Physics.\n\nLANGUAGES\n\nEnglish — B2\u2028\nGerman — B1\n\nhttps://learn.microsoft.com/api/credentials/share/ru-ru/levermory-8560/4AF21E3E64F51217?sharingId=3E8CF33B273FF5E3\nhttps://learn.microsoft.com/api/credentials/share/ru-ru/levermory-8560/4AF21E3E64F51217?sharingId=3E8CF33B273FF5E3\nhttps://learn.microsoft.com/api/credentials/share/en-us/levermory/AFA0DEC31A4DC81E?sharingId=3E8CF33B273FF5E3\nhttps://learn.microsoft.com/api/credentials/share/en-us/levermory/AFA0DEC31A4DC81E?sharingId=3E8CF33B273FF5E3\n\n• Integrated model into iOS application\n\n• Tried different delivery approaches for model wrapper\n\nEnvironment: ONNX Runtime, C++, CMake, XCode.\n\nSalesforce Engineer, iTechArt  — 2022\n\nInternship\n\nSKILLS\n\nPython, Numpy, Pandas, Plotly, OpenAI API, Langchain, ChromaDB, Ultralytics, ONNX, \nOpenCV, FastAPI, Celery, Docker, Docker compose, Bash/Zsh/Pwsh, Azure, GCP, Git.\n\n\tProfile\n\tCertificates\n\tEducation\n\tLanguages\n\tExperience\n\tSkills", 'fields': {'name': None, 'birthdate': None, 'phones': None, 'email': 'lev.taborov@icloud.com', 'salary': None, 'position': None, 'skype': None, 'telegram': None, 'experience': None}, 'parsing_meta': {'last_names_ignored': False, 'emails_ignored': False, 'phones_ignored': False}}
