est plans, acceptance criteria and test scenarios for each project.\n• Estimation and prioritization of tasks.\n• Writing detailed test cases and business requirements documents.\n• Analysis, writing reports and communicating results to colleagues, managers.\n• Monitoring testing process and identifying and logs test failure.\n• Communication with developers and PM to resolve issues.\n• Working with business and game analytics such as Apps Flyer, Tenjin, Firebase.\n• Monitoring advertising networks (Applovin, Chartboost, Ironsource, Unity Ads and etc).\n• App Store Review Guidelines.\n• Material Design for Android.\n\nОбразование\n\nВысшее\n\n2020 Belarusian National Technical University, Minsk\ninformation technology and robotics, Software for Computer Hardware and Automated Systems\n\nПовышение квалификации, курсы\n2018 Basic web and SQL for software testing\n\nSkill-Up\n\n2018\n\nBaran Dmitry  •  Резюме обновлено 2 декабря 2022 в 10:21 \n\nSoftware Testing Basics\nQA Academy\n\nКлючевые навыки\nЗнание языков Белорусский — Родной\n\nАнглийский — B1 — Средний\nРусский — C2 — В совершенстве\n\nНавыки  Atlassian Jira      SQL      Test case      Check-list      Analytical skills \n\n Bug Reporting      Black box testing      Quality Control      Jenkins      iOS testing \n\n Android testing      Charles Proxy      IronSource      Appsflyer      Tenjin      Firebase \n\n Apple Configurator      Client-Server Model      Chrome DevTools      Inspector Safari \n\n Test Design Techniques      Mobile testing      Playable ads testing      Mopub \n\n TeamCity \n\nОпыт вождения\n\nПрава категории\xa0B\n\nДополнительная информация\n\nОбо мне Experience in Information technologies with a focus on QA and testing of mobile and WEB\napplications. Strong working knowledge of Software testing (Functional testing, Smoke Testing,\nRegression Testing, Build Verification Testing). Experienced in Test Plans, Test Cases, Checklists\ndesigning. Was involved in all cycles of the test life 