le\n-> Senior)\n• Onboarded newcomers\n• Created Test Automation Framework base structure before other team members start writing tests\nusing it, to ensure everything will be consistent and similar code-style will be applied by all the\nteammates\n• Performed Code Review for all tasks and changes done by the team\n• Held multiple Knowledge Transfer sessions to share my experience with the team: about tools,\ncode-style, patterns and anti-patterns, mentoring, etc.\n\nNovember 2017\n— March 2021\n3 years 5 months\n\nEPAM Systems Inc (Беларусь)\nwww.epam.by\nIT, System Integration, Internet\n\n• System Integration, Technological and Business Processes Automation, IT Consulting\n\nTest Automation Engineer\nCreated Test Automation Framework under supervision\n\nAugust 2016\xa0—\nNovember 2017\n1 year 4 months\n\nEPAM Systems Inc (Беларусь)\nwww.epam.by\nIT, System Integration, Internet\n\n• System Integration, Technological and Business Processes Automation, IT Consulting\n\nJunior Test Automation Engineer\nAutomated test cases under supervision\n\nJuly 2014\xa0— July\n2016\n2 years 1 month\n\nWargaming.net\nFunctional Testing Engineer\nTested new maps, vehicles and balance\n\nEducation\n\nMaster\n\n2019 Belarusian State University of Informatics and Radioelectronics, Minsk\nComputer systems and networks, Mathematics. Computer Sciences\n\n2017 Belarusian State University, Minsk\n\nZaitsev Evgeny  •  Resume updated 20 November 2022 at 22:15\n\nApplied Mathematics and Informatics, Applied Mathematics and Informatics\n\nKey skills\nLanguages Russian — Native\n\nEnglish — B1 — Intermediate\n\nSkills  Leadership Skills      Customer orientation      Communication skills      Mentoring \n\n Interviews      Analytical skills      Английский язык      Negotiation skills \n\n Presentation skills      Teamleading \n\nFurther information\n\nAbout me I am a Test Automation Engineer with solid experience in creating, updating and maintaining Test\nAutomation Frameworks, which are written using different languages (Java, C#), with different\ntechnologies (Selenium, UIAutomation, Coded UI, API Testing) and different goals that TAF should\ncover (Smoke, Regression, Accessibility testing, Quality Gates, etc.). Also have positive experience\nbeing Tech Lead in team of up to 10 TA Engineers, half of which was under my responsibility. Have\nexperience in mentoring, onboarding, interviewing people. Currently want to grow as Lead\nspecialist with managerial tasks and want to take more responsibility as a leader, not as a solo\nspecialist.\n\nZaitsev Evgeny  •  Resume updated 20 November 2022 at 22:15\n\nHistory\nResponses Automation QA Lead\n\n19 November 2022\n\nZaitsev Evgeny  •  Resume updated 20 November 2022 at 22:15"}}]}
