, locust.io, LoadRunner)\n\nAlso, I have experience in automation testing: \n- Programming languages:  Python, Java, JS\n- UI automation: Selenium, Appium (and also  Selenide, Selene)\n- Testing Frameworks/libraries : Selenoid, Selenid, unittest, pytest,\nTestNG, JUnit, Cypress, CodedUI, TestStack.White\n- BDT/BDD: Robot Framework, JBehave, Behave, Specflow,\nCucumber\n\n\xa0 Page 1 of 2\n\nmailto:evgeni.menitsky@gmail.com\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/evgeni-menitsky?jobid=1234&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Ad_jobs_easyapply_pdfgenresume%3Bn4sNqKiISDKQW5HQkw6Mrw%3D%3D&licu=urn%3Ali%3Acontrol%3Ad_jobs_easyapply_pdfgenresume-v02_profile\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/evgeni-menitsky?jobid=1234&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Ad_jobs_easyapply_pdfgenresume%3Bn4sNqKiISDKQW5HQkw6Mrw%3D%3D&licu=urn%3Ali%3Acontrol%3Ad_jobs_easyapply_pdfgenresume-v02_profile\n\nОпыт работы\n\nA1QA\nQA Engineer\nдекабря 2016\xa0-\xa0Present\xa0(6 лет 2 месяца)\n\nОбразование\nПолоцкий государственный университет\nМагистр,\xa0Веб-приложения и интернет технологии\xa0·\xa0(2017\xa0-\xa02020)\n\nПолоцкий государственный университет\nБакалавр,\xa0Разработка программного обеспечения\xa0·\xa0(2016\xa0-\xa02017)\n\n\xa0 Page 2 of 2', 'fields': {'name': None, 'birthdate': None, 'phones': ['+375292153119'], 'email': 'evgeni.menitsky@gmail.com', 'salary': None, 'position': None, 'skype': None, 'telegram': None, 'experience': [{'position': 'QA Engineer at A1QA', 'company': None}, {'position': 'QA Engineer', 'company': None}]}, 'parsing_meta': {'last_names_ignored': False, 'emails_ignored': False, 'phones_ignored': False}}
