 C#      .NET Framework      MS SQL Server      Apache Maven      SQL      Git \n\n HTML      CSS      ASP.NET      MVC      Bootstrap      Английский язык      Jenkins \n\n Octopus      Autofac      REST      SOAP      SET .NET      Entity Framework      ADO.NET \n\nРезюме обновлено 29 марта 2023 в 11:07 \n\nGJ rabota.by\n\n Selenium      Cucumber      SpecFlow      NUnit      TestNG      ReshSharp      AWS \n\n Kibana      .NET Web API \n\nДополнительная информация\n\nОбо мне About 2,5+ years in IT, highly motivated in learning new technologies, oriented on high quality of\nproduct and result overall, pay attention to details, outstanding problem-solving skills.\nAs a Software Test Automation Engineer\n• Test documentation development and execution (test result reports, bug reports)\n• Theoretical knowledge and practical experience in different testing levels and types (Regression\ntesting, Function testing, Smoke/Critical testing)\n• Theoretical knowledge and practical experience in programming languages(OOP) such as C#,\nJava\n• Using different approaches in creation TAF using Autofac Dependency Injection, Page parts,\nlocators chain, reporting to ReportPortal\n• Working with data base maintaining and deployment of application\n• Using various tools for automated testing\n• An active member of all SCRUM meetings\n• Also expand my experience in\n• SET discipline, implemented application with ASP.MVC and Web Api\n• Mentorship in Re-skill program (Java -> .NET)\n• Conducting lectures in Test Automation for developers\n• Teaching basics of Java for children by participating in eKids program\n\nWORK EXPERIENCE\nMay-2021 - Till now\nSoftware Test Automation Engineer, EPAM Systems, https://www.epam.com/\nCustomer: Ticketmaster UK Limited\nCustomer Description: Travel & Hospitality\nEPAM Project Description: Development Support and On Call service for clients Sports Domains\nTeam Size: AQA 5 members\nProject Roles: AQA Tester\n\nResponsibilities:\n• Reviewing and analyzing test run reports\n• Developing and maintain test framework\n• Implementing auto tests\n• Investigating and reporting bugs\n• Improving test automation efficiency\n\nTools and Technologies: MS SQL, AWS,\nGIT, GitLab\nConfluence,\nJira, TestRail,\nVisual Studio,\nOctopus, Kibana\nSelenium WebDriver, .Net, Xpath, HTML/CSS\n\nDec-2020 - May-2021 - Junior Software Test Automation Engineer, EPAM Systems,\nhttps://www.epam.com/\nCustomer: EPAM Systems, Inc\nCustomer Description: Software & Hi-Tech\nEPAM Project Description: Resource Development processes automation\nTeam Size: Manager: 1 member,\nAQA team: 4 members\n\nShasholko Ivan  •  Резюме обновлено 29 марта 2023 в 11:07 \n\nProject Roles: Software Test Automation Engineer in Java\n\nResponsibilities:\n• Developing and supporting the framework\n• Implement UI automation tests for the new features\n• Running test launches\n• Investigate failed scenarios\n• Bug reporting in Jira\n• Bug fixing of automation tests\n• Participation in code review\n\nTools and Technologies: Jenkins, Git, Report Portal, JIRA, IntelliJ IDEA\nSelenium, Java, Maven, Log4j2, TestNG\n\nEDUCATION AT EPAM SYSTEMS\n• Automated testing: Advanced\n• Software Engineer in Test .NET\n• Software Engineer in .NET : Basic\nMY WORKS\n• AQA Framework: https://github.com/Yo371/AQA.Blank\n• Application during SET .NET program: https://github.com/Yo371/bookshopapi\n\nShasholko Ivan  •  Резюме обновлено 29 марта 2023 в 11:07 \n\nИстория общения с кандидатом\nОтклики QA Engineer (Fullstack | Automation)\n\n31 марта 2023\n\nShasholko Ivan  •  Резюме обновлено 29 марта 2023 в 11:07', 'fields': {'name': {'first': 'Ivan', 'last': 'Shasholko', 'middle': None}, 'birthdate': None, 'phones': ['+375 (29) 8067573'], 'email': 'ivan.shasholko@gmail.com', 'salary': None, 'position': 'Software Test Automation Engineer .NET, Java', 'skype': None, 'telegram': None, 'experience': [{'position': 'SOFTWARE TEST AUTOMATION ENGINEER .NET, Java', 'company': 'EPAM Systems Inc (Белару