ns across the world still rely on them to prove who they are across a wealth of\ncritical services including health, education, financial and electoral.\nTechnologies: Scrum, Java, iOS, Android, React\nMain achievements: Scrum Master, ISO procedures, backlog formation\nMy responsibilities included:\n● Agile process introduction (sprints configuring, holding agile meetings, etc.)\n● Documentation development (release and sprint reports, regarding preparation for ISO 27001)\n● Backlog formation and managing\n● Communications with Marketing, Sales Teams, CEO and managing of requirements and\nexpectations\n● Managing of the development process (tasks are defined, clear and done in time according the\npriority)\n● Monitoring of the development process (meetings, reports for each employee)\n● ISO certification preparation\n● Incident Management\n● Development, optimization and control of team based multiple department workflow\n\nApril 2018\xa0—\nDecember 2018\n9 months\n\nSociumtrade\nMogilev,\xa0sociumtrade.com/\n\nProduct Owner, Lead QA Engineer, Project Manager\nProject: Mobile app - SociumLend - Lending platform that allows get fiat loans under the pledge of\ncrypto using the ETH smart-contracts.\nTechnologies: Scrum, Java, AWS, React Native, Node.js, Postgres\nMain achievements: Blockchain technologies, ETH smart-contracts testing, Release and delivery\nmanagement, requirements describing\n\nMakolskaya Dasha  •  Resume updated 12 June 2023 at 22:38\n\nMy responsibilities included:\n● Create and maintain detailed and well-structured test plans, test case and user guides\n● Functional testing, UAT testing\n● Release and delivery management\n● Monitoring of external development (SociumLend as a client)\n● Develop a detailed project plan to track progress\n● Description of functional and non-functional requirements for the product\n● Work both independently and in the close together with others in the team and across the\nbusiness\n● Establish and maintain relationships