, Ruby, Circle CI, API\nИнтерфейсы, Автоматизация процессов\n\nДекабрь 2017 — \nФевраль 2019\n(1 год и 3 месяца)\n\nHippo\nSenior QA Automation Engineer\n\nОбязанности и достижения\nQA consultant:\n\n- Mobile automation with ruby/appium/cucumber\n- Web automation with ruby/selenium/cucumber\n- API functional tests with: GO/GoDog, Ruby\n- Performance POC on Gatling\n- UI integration tests on JS and Cypress\n- CI/CD setup \n- QA planning, manual testing, PR review\n\nRuby, Cucumber, Watir, JS, TS, Go, Bash, Git, Docker, CircleCi, BDD,\nAppium/Selenium\n\nМай 2016 — \nДекабрь 2017\n(1 год и 8 месяцев)\n\nEPAM\nSenior QA Automation\nБеларусь, Минск\n\nОбязанности и достижения\n* KRONOS [www.kronos.com]\n\nTeam Lead QA Automation:\n- Writing automation test cases, reviewing pull requests\n- Reviewing, correcting, and creating test cases for automation. Making\nscenarios useful and testable\n- Building Selenium framework from scratch\n- Participating in SoapUI automation testing\n- Created "POC" of REST-Assured based framework\n- Created desktop application helpers for manual testers (Java-Swing)\n- Interviewing and training beginners\n- Communication with customer\n\nJava, Selenium, TestNG, Maven\n\n* EPIC GAMES [www.epicgames.com]\nSenior QA Automation\n- Migrating from Jmeter to JUnit-based API framework\n- Improving custom API framework\n- Improve test reporting\n\nJava, Rest-assured, Spring, Spring AOP, JUnit, Gradle\n\nhttp://www.kronos.com\nhttp://www.epicgames.com\n\nПрименяемые навыки\nJava, Jenkins, Selenium\n\nИюнь 2013 — \nМай 2016\n(3 года)\n\nFICO\nSenior QA\nСША, Сан-Диего\n\nОбязанности и достижения\n- Manual testing\n- Writing Test Plan, Test Cases\n- Test automation: UI testing (Selenium), API testing\n- CI integration\n\nJava, Selenium, Jenkins, REST API\n\nПрименяемые навыки\nJava, REST, Selenium\n\nВысшее образование\n\nАвгуст 2013 — \nМай 2015\n\nБелорусский национальный технический университет\nИнститут повышения квалификации и переподготовки кадров