reating Test Plans, Test Scenarios/Cases and Bug Reports; \nPerformed smoke and regression testing, created and executed\ntest cases, checklists; \nSetting QA SCRUM testing process; \nCoordinated with developers to fix application defects; \nResponsible for analyzing requirements and updating test\ndocumentation;\n\nАпрель 2014 — \nДекабрь 2014\n(9 месяцев)\n\nStrevus\nSenior QA\nБеларусь, Минск\n\nОбязанности и достижения\n\nPerformed functional, UI testing, localization testing, stress\ntesting, integration testing; \nCreating Test Plans, Test Scenarios/Cases and Bug Reports; \nPerformed smoke and regression testing, created and executed\ntest cases, checklists; \nSetting QA SCRUM testing process; \nCoordinated with developers to fix application defects; \nResponsible for analyzing requirements and updating test\ndocumentation;\nParticipated in knowledge transfer meetings;\n\nИюнь 2010 — \nМарт 2014\n(3 года и 10 месяцев)\n\nEPAM\nQA\nБеларусь, Минск\n\nВысшее образование\n\nСентябрь 2007 — \nИюнь 2012\n\nБелорусский государственный университет информатики\nи радиоэлектроники\nИнформационных технологий и управления (ФИТиУ)\nБеларусь, Минск\n\nСпециализация и достижения\nЗакончил университет с красным дипломом.\n\nДополнительное образование\n\nИюнь 2019 — \nЯнварь 2020\n\nTeach Me Skills\n\nПройденный курс\nSelenium Java Automation (Advanced).\n\nУлучшенные навыки\n\nJava, Selenium, Apache Maven, Git, Jenkins, Scrum, Функциональное\nтестирование, Cucumber, Apache JMeter\n\nО себе\n\nI’m a professional Software QA Engineer. For todays, I have more than 10 years of experience in Quality\nAssurance. I have deep experience with setting QA processes by Scrum methodology, leading QA team,\ncreating all types of testing documentation. Also experienced in back-end and integration testing. And\ncreation testing frameworks based on Java.\n\nSUMMARY:\n\n10 years in Software Testing domain for web / client-server\nAdvanced knowledge in Systems Development Life Cycle methodologies: Scrum master, Kanban;\nExperienced in designing testing documentation: Test Plans, Test Scenarios/Cases and Bug\nReports;\nStrong knowledge of all Functional Testing methodologies: Unit/Smoke/Integration/Regression;\nExperienced in development automation tests framework, CI flow, automated reporting;\nProvided high-quality functional requirement and specification review and analysis;\nExperienced in back-end and integration testing;\nDocumented software defects using Defect Tracking systems;\nGood knowledge in social media / media & entertainment / finance / hospitality / etc. domains;\nProficient in status reporting and issue escalations;\nExcellent interpersonal, organizational, and written/verbal communications skills\nAdvanced level of English\n\nTECHNICAL BACKGROUND:\n\nE2E automation:\nSelenium + Java (Selenium WebDriver / Selenide)\nCodeceptJS + NodeJS\n\nREST API automation:\nRest-assured\nAxios\n\nMobile automation: Appium, Xcode, Android Studio, Browserstack\n\nBuild tools: Maven, Gradle\nTest frameworks TestNG, Junit\nReporting: Allure\nContinuous integration: Jenkins, CircleCI, GitlabCI\nData formats: JSON, HTML\nPatterns: \n\nAutomation patterns:\nPage Object , Page Factory, Fluent/Chain of invocations, Loadable Page/Component, Value\nObject\nGOF patterns: Singleton, Factory, Builder and etc.\n\nTest-driven development: Cucumber (gherkin)\nPerformance testing: Jmeter, BlazeMeter\nOther Tools: IntelliJ IDEA, Github, Postman, Jira, Fiddler, Charles, TestRail, Jenkins, SLQ tools,\nAdobe Experience Manager\n\nХабр Карьера — вакансии для IT-специалистов\n\n\tСергей Евсеенко\n\tМестоположение\n\tВозраст и стаж\n\tКонтактная информация\n\tПрофессиональные навыки\n\tОпыт работы\n\tФриланс\n\tОбязанности и достижения\n\tПрименяемые навыки\n\n\tIG DEV\n\tОбязанности и достижения\n\n\tStrevus\n\tОбязанности и достижения\n\n\tEPAM\n\n\tВысшее образование\n\tБелорусский государственный университет информатики и радиоэлектроники\n\tСпециализация и достижения\n\n