[2026-01-27 17:33:16,497: WARNING/ForkPoolWorker-1] 🔍 Начинаем создание кандидата из данных: {'id': 104984256, 'url': 'https://store.huntflow.ru/uploads3/named/7/8/2/78286d69d08b21ebc684da5ac1792665.pdf/Profile%2520%2843%29.pdf?s=PrZbsxyaU05zAOkzBSDp5Q&e=1769567596', 'content_type': 'application/pdf', 'name': 'Profile%20(43).pdf', 'text': 'Способы связаться\nnikita.maslovski13@gmail.co\nm\n\nwww.linkedin.com/in/nikita-\nmaslovski (LinkedIn)\n\nОсновные навыки\nTypeScript\nwebdriver.io\nReact\n\nLanguages\nАнглийский (Limited Working)\nРусский (Native or Bilingual)\n\nCertifications\nModern React with Redux\nHTML, CSS, JavaScript\nScala 2 for Beginners\nJavaScript - The Complete Guide\n2020 (Beginner + Advanced)\nDocker and Kubernetes: The\nComplete Guide\n\nNikita Maslovski\nSenior QA Automation Engineer - Evolution\nМинск, Республика Беларусь\n\nОбщие сведения\nI am an active, responsible and purposeful person. I always get\nthings done and never give up in front of any difficulties. I like to\ncommunicate with people and also be in a circle of like-minded\npeople.\n\nОпыт работы\n\nEvolution\n3 года\n\nSenior QA Automation Engineer\nоктября 2021\xa0-\xa0Present\xa0(2 года)\nМинск, Республика Беларусь\n\nQA Automation Engineer\nоктября 2020\xa0-\xa0октября 2021\xa0(1 год 1 месяц)\nМинск, Республика Беларусь\n\nPersonally supervised test automation (E2E, UI, unit, backend) in the Scrum\nteam (consisting of 8 people). The team is responsible for 6 casino games:\n3 dice games (Lightning Dice and Super SicBo, First Person Super SicBo),\n2 game shows (Deal or No Deal, First Person Deal No Deal) and slot game\n(Jack and Beanstalk Remastered). The games are a React application with\nlive streaming from the studio with user interface and Scala backend. First\nPerson games developed in Babylon.js and Pixi.js \n\nI reviewed the games requirements, compiled test cases for these\nrequirements, and made a plan for covering the application with autotests. \n\nIn addition, I have experience in mentoring manual QAs in test automation (at\n2022 and 2023). All of them successfully switched to QA Automation position.\n\nStack: TS, WDIO, Cucumber, Allure, Browserstack, Storybook, Selenoid,\nGitLab, Jenkins\n\nАльфа-Банк (Беларусь)\n\xa0 Page 1 of 3\n\nmailto:nikita.maslovski13@gmail.com\nmailto:nikita.maslovski13@gmail.com\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/nikita-maslovski?jobid=1234&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Ad_jobs_easyapply_pdfgenresume%3B%2F%2F0Q95yES%2BaZ9E%2FU8askeg%3D%3D&licu=urn%3Ali%3Acontrol%3Ad_jobs_easyapply_pdfgenresume-v02_profile\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/nikita-maslovski?jobid=1234&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Ad_jobs_easyapply_pdfgenresume%3B%2F%2F0Q95yES%2BaZ9E%2FU8askeg%3D%3D&licu=urn%3Ali%3Acontrol%3Ad_jobs_easyapply_pdfgenresume-v02_profile\n\nQA Automation Engineer\nоктября 2017\xa0-\xa0октября 2020\xa0(3 года 1 месяц)\nМинск, Республика Беларусь\n\nSupport for a software testing automation project for cash management\nsystem. \nStack: Java, Sikuli, Cucumber, Hibernate.\n\nBuilding from scratch a framework for testing automation and establishing\nprimary DevOps processes on a project, which is a web application (.NET\nCore) for remote submission of loan applications for bank partners. \nStack: C#, SpecFlow, Selenium, Bamboo.\n\nAdvising on the implementation of test automation and DevSecOps processes\non two advanced bank projects (factoring system, deposits for business\nclients). Projects are splitting a large monolith into microservices, as well as\nusing agile development methodologies (Scrum). \nStack: TypeScript, Webdriver.io, Jest, Cucumber, Bamboo.\n\nСчастливая семья\nQA Automation Engineer\nмарта 2018\xa0-\xa0февраля 2020\xa0(2 года)\nМинск, Республика Беларусь\n\nThe project is a service for convenient and quick formation of a menu for a\nweek based on all human needs (taste, financial and other needs).\n\nPersonally led the implementation of test automation and DevOps processes\nfrom scratch.\nImplemented testing of the backend system in Java using the following\ntechnologies: Java, Selenide, Cucumber, RestAssured, SerenityBDD.\n\nAnd also E2E testing of a website in JavaScript using the following\ntechnologies: TypeScript, WebdriverIO, Jest, Cucumber.\n\nAdditional technologies: Docker (Selenoid), Jira Cloud \\ Bitbucket Cloud,\nJenkins.\n\nОбразование\nIT Academy\n\n\xa0 Page 2 of 3\n\nFD1: Разработка веб-сайтов с использованием HTML, CSS и\nJavaScript.\xa0·\xa0(2018\xa0-\xa02018)\n\nIT Academy\nFD2: Разработка веб-приложений на JavaScript\xa0·\xa0(2019\xa0-\xa02019)\n\nSkillFactory\nРазработчик игр на Unity\xa0·\xa0(февраля 2023\xa0-\xa0августа 2024)\n\nStreamLine\nEnglish Intermediate Level Course\xa0·\xa0(2019\xa0-\xa02019)\n\nStreamline\nEnglish Upper-Intermediate Level Course\xa0·\xa0(2020\xa0-\xa02020)\n\n\xa0 Page 3 of 3', 'fields': {'name': None, 'birthdate': None, 'phones': None, 'email': 'nikita.maslovski13@gmail.com', 'salary': None, 'position': None, 'skype': None, 'telegram': None, 'experience': [{'position': 'QA Automation Engineer', 'company': None}, {'position': 'Разработчик игр на Unity\xa0·\xa0(февраля 2023\xa0-\xa0августа 2024', 'company': None}]}, 'parsing_meta': {'last_names_ignored': False, 'emails_ignored': False, 'phones_ignored': False}}
